meta {
  name: Sandbox status
  type: http
  seq: 51
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/sim/players/:sessionId
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  sessionId: 250
}

docs {
  200 { sessionId, running, timeScale, startedAt, endedAt, warnings, boats:[{deviceId, played, total, uploaded, done}] }
  200 { sessionId, running:false, boats:[] }   // nothing is sailing this session

  Todo 63 — the sandbox's progress: how many fixes each boat has posted and
  whether its run has landed. Never 404: "no player" is an answer, because a
  finished player is pruned after 10 minutes (like its runs) and the pane has to
  survive that.

  `running` is false once every boat uploaded or failed, and immediately after a
  stop. A boat that failed keeps `failed: true` and the reason is in `warnings`.
}
